# Dependencies
**/node_modules
**/.npm

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.nuxt

# Logs
**/logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*

# Environment files (never bake secrets into images)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# OS / Editor artifacts
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Git
.git
.gitignore

# Docker files themselves (not needed inside image)
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*.yml

# Windows binaries (not needed in Linux containers)
**/*.exe
**/*.msi
**/*.bat
**/*.cmd
**/pkg-output

# Test / CI artifacts
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/__tests__
**/*.test.*
**/*.spec.*

# Documentation
**/documentation
**/README*
**/CHANGELOG*